THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS

The MIT license above covers all original work in this repository: the Simulink
models (`*.slx`), the MATLAB scripts (`*.m`), the controller C sources under
`sil/`, the tests, the project configuration and the documentation.

No third-party source code is vendored here. In particular:

  MATLAB(R), Simulink(R), Embedded Coder(R) and the MinGW-w64 compiler used by
  `mex` are NOT redistributed in this repository. They are licensed separately
  by their respective vendors and are required to open and run this project.

  resources/project/  is MATLAB Project metadata generated by MATLAB. It
      contains no MathWorks source code -- only project bookkeeping (file
      identifiers, labels, dependency records) describing THIS project.

  sil/*.mexw64  are compiled MEX binaries built by `sil/build_sfun.m` from the
      original C sources in the same directory. They are original work; they
      contain no MathWorks code and can be regenerated from source at any time.

  sil/flight_ctrl.c and sil/flight_ctrl.h are byte-identical to the controller
      sources in the AurixTricore firmware repository, and are original work
      under the same MIT license. That is intentional: the identical translation
      unit is what makes the SiL and PiL comparison meaningful.

